WEBVTT

00:07.341 --> 00:08.676
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:08.742 --> 00:10.311
kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.378 --> 00:11.845
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:11.912 --> 00:13.947
kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.014 --> 00:16.917
- * Ohh... *
-*哦...*

00:16.984 --> 00:18.952
* Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:19.019 --> 00:21.021
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.089 --> 00:22.856
- * Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he *
- * 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的*

00:22.923 --> 00:24.792
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:24.858 --> 00:26.994
- * If nautical nonsense
be something you wish *
- *如果航海废话
成为你所希望的*

00:27.061 --> 00:29.063
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.130 --> 00:30.964
- * Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish *
- * 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通 *

00:31.031 --> 00:32.966
kids: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
孩子们：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.033 --> 00:34.768
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:34.835 --> 00:37.105
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.171 --> 00:39.039
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.107 --> 00:40.341
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.408 --> 00:42.210
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.276 --> 00:44.978
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.045 --> 00:47.215
[flute plays]
[长笛演奏]

00:47.281 --> 00:48.682
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:50.318 --> 00:53.421
[bright music]
[明亮的音乐]

01:00.194 --> 01:02.663
- All right, Science Scouts,
listen up.
- 好吧，科学童子军，
听着。

01:02.730 --> 01:05.766
This here business is serious
as a rattlesnake bite,
这里的生意很严肃
就像响尾蛇咬伤一样，

01:05.833 --> 01:07.868
so let's make sure
we don't mess it up.
所以让我们确定一下
我们不会把事情搞砸的。

01:07.935 --> 01:11.038
If we earn enough money,
we can finally
如果我们赚到足够的钱，
我们终于可以

01:11.105 --> 01:13.174
afford that trip to Mars!
负担得起火星之旅！

01:13.241 --> 01:14.775
[grunts]
[咕哝]

01:14.842 --> 01:17.878
Now, get out there
and sell these biscuits!
现在，出去吧
并卖掉这些饼干！

01:17.945 --> 01:20.948
[together] Aye, aye,
Science Master Sandy.
[合] 是啊是啊
科学大师桑迪。

01:21.014 --> 01:23.451
* *
**
**
**

01:23.517 --> 01:25.186
[doorbell rings]
[门铃响]

01:25.253 --> 01:29.123
- What's all that racket?
- Good day, ma'ams.
- 那是什么喧嚣？
- 美好的一天，女士们。

01:29.190 --> 01:32.560
Would you like to buy
some Science Scouts biscuits?
你想买吗
一些科学童子军饼干？

01:32.626 --> 01:34.728
- Science?
Puh!
- 科学？
噗！

01:34.795 --> 01:36.864
That malarkey ain't real.
那个胡言乱语不是真的。

01:36.930 --> 01:39.700
Back in my day, we had alchemy,
在我那个时代，我们有炼金术，

01:39.767 --> 01:41.935
and that was
good enough for us.
那是
对我们来说已经足够好了。

01:43.036 --> 01:45.806
- Aw.
- Mary, it's Wednesday.
- 噢。
- 玛丽，今天是星期三。

01:45.873 --> 01:49.277
Time to shave down my bunions!
- Ugh!
是时候剃掉我的拇囊炎了！
- 呃！

01:49.343 --> 01:50.844
[tools grinding]
[工具磨削]

01:50.911 --> 01:52.713
Ew.
呃。

01:52.780 --> 01:55.115
[eerie music]
[诡异的音乐]

01:55.183 --> 01:57.618
[wolf howling]
[狼嚎]

01:57.685 --> 02:00.488
[knocker clangs]
[门环叮当声]

02:00.554 --> 02:03.123
- Who is it?
- 是谁？

02:03.191 --> 02:06.594
- Good day, sir.
Are you the man of the house?
- 美好的一天，先生。
你是一家之主吗？

02:06.660 --> 02:11.199
- Oh, no.
The master is in repose.
- 哦，不。
主人正在休息。

02:11.265 --> 02:13.934
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

02:14.001 --> 02:16.804
- Well, perhaps your master
would like to wake up
- 嗯，也许是你的主人
想要醒来

02:16.870 --> 02:19.773
to some fresh-baked biscuits.
- Oh, no.
一些新鲜出炉的饼干。
- 哦，不。

02:19.840 --> 02:22.876
He doesn't care
for solid foods.
他不在乎
用于固体食物。

02:24.445 --> 02:27.581
[slurping]
[发出声音]

02:29.283 --> 02:32.820
Master does get thirsty though.
Sorry.
师父确实会渴。
对不起。

02:32.886 --> 02:34.622
- [strained, high-pitched]
No problem.
- [紧张，高亢]
没问题。

02:34.688 --> 02:37.725
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

02:37.791 --> 02:41.295
- Sup, little lady bro?
- Yes, hello, sir.
- 好的，小女士兄弟？
- 是的，你好，先生。

02:41.362 --> 02:44.898
Have you considered purchasing
some Science Scout bis--
您是否考虑过购买
一些科学童子军之二——

02:44.965 --> 02:47.635
um...
- [grunting]
嗯...
- [咕哝]

02:47.701 --> 02:50.738
- I mean, energy bars?
- 我是说，能量棒？

02:50.804 --> 02:53.974
They will fill you
with the fuel for fitness!
他们会充满你
为健身加油！

02:54.041 --> 02:57.177
- Well, Larry does need
to carbo load.
- 好吧，拉里确实需要
碳负荷。

02:57.245 --> 02:59.647
I'll take a dozen boxes.
我要买十几盒。

02:59.713 --> 03:01.515
[cash register chimes]
[收银机铃声]

03:01.582 --> 03:03.183
* *
**
**
**

03:03.251 --> 03:05.419
Ah!
[chewing]
啊!
[咀嚼]

03:05.486 --> 03:07.120
Yeah!
是的！

03:08.622 --> 03:12.360
- We got our first sale.
- Whoo-hoo!
- 我们得到了第一笔销售。
- 呼呼！

03:12.426 --> 03:14.728
* *
**
**
**

03:14.795 --> 03:16.364
[doorbell ringing]
[门铃响]

03:16.430 --> 03:17.565
[cash register chimes]
[收银机铃声]

03:17.631 --> 03:19.066
[knocks]
[敲门声]

03:19.132 --> 03:22.202
* *
**
**
**

03:22.270 --> 03:25.506
- [laughs]
Oh, yay!
- [笑]
哦，耶！

03:25.573 --> 03:29.610
[coughing]
[咳嗽]

03:31.245 --> 03:34.915
Oh, my aching knuckles.
哦，我的指关节好痛。

03:34.982 --> 03:39.887
I must have knocked on
a million doors today.
我一定是敲过
今天有一百万扇门。

03:39.953 --> 03:43.056
[money twinkling]
[金钱闪烁]

03:44.892 --> 03:49.997
- [sniffs]
Money?
- [嗅嗅]
钱？

03:50.063 --> 03:55.303
[giggles]
Tasty morsels for the Krabsy.
[咯咯笑]
Krabsy 的美味佳肴。

03:55.369 --> 03:57.037
- Hey, claws off!
- 嘿，爪子拿开！

03:57.104 --> 03:59.640
That money belongs
to the Science Scouts.
这笔钱属于
给科学童子军。

03:59.707 --> 04:02.710
I got it from selling biscuits.
我是卖饼干得来的。

04:02.776 --> 04:08.081
- Selling biscuitses, eh?
[giggles]
- 卖饼干吧？
[咯咯笑]

04:08.148 --> 04:09.917
- All right,
that was some fancy
- 好吧，
那是一些奇特的

04:09.983 --> 04:13.287
biscuit hawking yesterday,
but today, we're going to--
昨天贩卖饼干，
但今天，我们要——

04:13.354 --> 04:14.888
hey, where's SpongeBob?
嘿，海绵宝宝在哪里？

04:14.955 --> 04:16.857
- He's over there
with Mr. Krabs
- 他在那边
与蟹老板

04:16.924 --> 04:19.627
and that sad-looking octopus.
还有那只一脸悲伤的章鱼。

04:19.693 --> 04:22.162
- SpongeBob,
what are you doing?
- 海绵宝宝，
你在做什么？

04:22.229 --> 04:25.633
- He's working with the premier
biscuit-selling team
- 他正在与总理合作
卖饼干的团队

04:25.699 --> 04:28.702
in Bikini Bottom,
that's what he's doing.
在比基尼下装，
这就是他正在做的事情。

04:28.769 --> 04:30.871
Now, if you don't mind,
现在，如果你不介意的话，

04:30.938 --> 04:34.074
we've got some Krusty Doodles
to sell.
我们有一些 Krusty 涂鸦
出售。

04:34.141 --> 04:35.476
- Krusty Doodles?
- 库斯蒂涂鸦？

04:35.543 --> 04:37.244
[chomps]
Blech!
[咀嚼]
布莱赫！

04:37.311 --> 04:41.281
These are just
stale Krabby Patty buns.
这些只是
不新鲜的蟹黄小面包。

04:41.349 --> 04:44.785
- Aged to perfection
and sprinkled with cinnamon.
- 陈年至完美
并撒上肉桂。

04:44.852 --> 04:48.121
Now, scram!
This is Krusty Scout territory.
现在，滚吧！
这是库斯蒂侦察兵的领地。

04:48.188 --> 04:51.625
- Oh, no, this is
Science Scout territory.
- 哦，不，这是
科学侦察领地。

04:51.692 --> 04:54.194
- Oh, yeah?
How about a little wager?
- 哦，是吗？
来点小赌怎么样？

04:54.261 --> 04:58.966
Whoever sells the most biscuits
today gets to keep selling.
谁卖的饼干最多
今天继续销售。

04:59.032 --> 05:03.737
- And the loser leaves
the biscuit biz forever!
- 失败者离开
永远的饼干生意！

05:03.804 --> 05:06.607
[together]
Deal.
[一起]
成交。

05:06.674 --> 05:10.411
[knocks]
- Hmm? Oh, no.
[敲门声]
- 嗯？哦，不。

05:10.478 --> 05:12.846
A solicitor.
- [grunts]
一名律师。
- [咕哝]

05:12.913 --> 05:15.148
Friend,
how would you like to buy
朋友，
你想买什么

05:15.215 --> 05:19.019
the most collectible snack
in the whole ocean?
最有收藏价值的零食
在整个海洋？

05:19.086 --> 05:22.956
They're mint biscuits
in mint condition.
它们是薄荷饼干
完好无损。

05:23.023 --> 05:25.659
- Ooh, mint, you say?
- 哦，薄荷糖，你说？

05:25.726 --> 05:28.061
- If you want
real biscuit flavor,
- 如果你愿意的话
真正的饼干味道，

05:28.128 --> 05:32.232
try a Krusty Doodle instead.
尝试一下 Krusty Doodle。

05:32.299 --> 05:34.968
- Your cosplay is terrible.
I'll pass.
- 你的角色扮演太糟糕了。
我会通过。

05:35.035 --> 05:37.905
Give me three boxes.
- Whoa!
给我三盒。
- 哇！

05:37.971 --> 05:39.473
- Avast, Mr. Squidward.
- Avast，章鱼哥先生。

05:39.540 --> 05:43.276
If you want to move biscuits,
you gotta be cuter.
如果你想搬饼干，
你必须更可爱。

05:43.343 --> 05:45.446
Here, I'll help you.
- [grunts]
在这里，我会帮助你。
- [咕哝]

05:45.513 --> 05:47.715
[air hisses]
[空气嘶嘶声]

05:47.781 --> 05:51.118
There you go.
Now you're adorable, see?
就这样吧。
现在你很可爱，看到了吗？

05:51.184 --> 05:54.154
- I can't see anything.
My retinas detached.
- 我什么也看不见。
我的视网膜脱落了。

05:57.324 --> 05:59.727
[doorbell rings]
[门铃响]

05:59.793 --> 06:03.296
- Oh, Pearl,
don't you look cute?
- 哦，珍珠，
你看起来不可爱吗？

06:03.363 --> 06:05.566
- Oh, thanks, Mrs. Puff.
- 噢，谢谢，普芙女士。

06:05.633 --> 06:09.903
I'm selling biscuits so
my scout troop can go to Mars.
我是卖饼干的
我的侦察兵部队可以去火星。

06:09.970 --> 06:13.040
- Adorable.
Let me get my purse.
- 可爱。
让我拿一下我的钱包。

06:13.106 --> 06:15.976
- Wait a minute.
Buy my biscuits instead!
- 等一下。
不如买我的饼干吧！

06:16.043 --> 06:18.311
- What's wrong with
your eyes, Squidward?
- 有什么问题吗
你的眼睛，章鱼哥？

06:18.378 --> 06:21.849
- You're blowing it again.
I'll show you how it's done.
- 你又搞砸了。
我将向您展示它是如何完成的。

06:21.915 --> 06:24.752
[tender music]
[温柔的音乐]

06:24.818 --> 06:27.320
Hello, my sweet Puffikins.
你好，我可爱的海雀。

06:27.387 --> 06:30.558
Won't you buy some biscuits
from the only crab
你不买点饼干吗
来自唯一的螃蟹

06:30.624 --> 06:32.726
to ever steal your heart?
永远偷走你的心吗？

06:32.793 --> 06:35.996
- Oh, well,
that does sound nice.
- 哦，好吧，
听起来不错。

06:36.063 --> 06:37.431
- Don't listen to him.
- 别听他的。

06:37.498 --> 06:39.567
My biscuits are better,
Mrs. Puff.
我的饼干更好吃
泡芙女士。

06:39.633 --> 06:40.801
- Don't listen to her!
- 别听她的！

06:40.868 --> 06:42.436
- Hey, find your own house
to sell at!
- 嘿，找到你自己的房子
出售！

06:42.503 --> 06:44.271
- Hey, get your biscuit
right here.
- 嘿，拿你的饼干来
就在这里。

06:44.337 --> 06:46.173
- Come on, buy mine!
- Uh-huh.
- 来吧，买我的！
- 呃哈。

06:46.239 --> 06:48.609
[brawlers arguing indistinctly]
[争吵者模糊地争论]

06:48.676 --> 06:50.444
[boat honks]
- Oh!
[船鸣笛]
- 哦！

06:50.511 --> 06:52.145
- Would you like
to buy some biscuits?
- 你愿意吗
买一些饼干？

06:52.212 --> 06:53.614
- No!
- 不！

06:53.681 --> 06:54.815
- Are you sure you don't want
to buy some biscuits?
- 你确定你不想要
买一些饼干？

06:54.882 --> 06:56.216
- Yes.
- 是的。

06:56.283 --> 06:58.919
- How about our super spicy
cinnamon biscuits?
- 我们的超辣怎么样
肉桂饼干？

06:58.986 --> 07:01.622
[tires thud]
[轮胎轰鸣声]

07:01.689 --> 07:04.825
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

07:07.260 --> 07:10.330
[brawlers arguing indistinctly]
[争吵者模糊地争论]

07:10.397 --> 07:12.132
[record scratch]
[记录刮痕]

07:12.199 --> 07:14.034
- Why did everyone
stop yelling?
- 为什么大家都
别喊了？

07:14.101 --> 07:15.335
[boat honking]
- [screaming]
[船鸣笛]
- [尖叫]

07:15.402 --> 07:17.370
[explosion]
[爆炸]

07:17.437 --> 07:20.007
[bright music]
[明亮的音乐]

07:20.073 --> 07:23.210
[all groaning]
[全都呻吟]

07:24.444 --> 07:26.614
- Well, looks like
the biscuit business
- 嗯，看起来像
饼干生意

07:26.680 --> 07:29.517
is all mine now.
[sniffing]
现在都是我的了。
[嗅嗅]

07:29.583 --> 07:31.652
- We ain't letting him
win this one.
- 我们不会让他
赢得这一场。

07:31.719 --> 07:34.955
Come on, Science Scouts!
Ugh! Oh.
加油，科学侦察兵！
啊!哦。

07:35.022 --> 07:38.125
- Oh, why not let it go, Sandy?
- 哦，为什么不放手呢，桑迪？

07:38.191 --> 07:41.128
There's only one place left
in town to sell to anyway,
只剩下一个位置了
无论如何，在城里出售，

07:41.194 --> 07:43.130
the old folks home,
老人家，

07:43.196 --> 07:46.700
and you'd have to sell
to every single oldie there
你必须卖掉
致每一位老歌

07:46.767 --> 07:47.901
to beat me.
打败我。

07:47.968 --> 07:50.070
- Looks like
it's up to you, Pearl.
- 看起来像
这取决于你，珀尔。

07:50.137 --> 07:51.772
[steam whistle toots]
[汽笛嘟嘟]

07:51.839 --> 07:54.107
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

07:54.174 --> 07:55.543
- What?
Wait, what?
- 什么？
等等，什么？

07:55.609 --> 07:58.011
That was my plan.
这就是我的计划。

07:58.078 --> 08:01.348
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

08:01.414 --> 08:04.417
* *
**
**
**

08:04.484 --> 08:06.854
- I believe this
belongs to you.
- 我相信这一点
属于你。

08:06.920 --> 08:08.789
Ah.
啊。

08:08.856 --> 08:12.860
[laughs]
- Huh? Huh?
[笑]
- 啊？啊？

08:12.926 --> 08:16.664
Ah, my biscuits!
啊，我的饼干！

08:16.730 --> 08:18.431
[bike whooshes]
[自行车呼啸声]

08:18.498 --> 08:21.401
- [chuckles]
Nothing beats sabotage-y.
- [轻笑]
没有什么比破坏更重要的了。

08:21.468 --> 08:22.469
[sparks crackling]
[火花噼啪作响]

08:22.536 --> 08:24.738
Huh?
Me brakes?
啊？
我刹车？

08:24.805 --> 08:27.107
They've been sabotagied!
他们被破坏了！

08:27.174 --> 08:30.644
[tires screech]
Oh!
[轮胎尖叫声]
哦！

08:30.711 --> 08:35.448
* *
**
**
**

08:35.515 --> 08:37.785
[explosion]
[爆炸]

08:37.851 --> 08:43.691
* *
**
**
**

08:43.757 --> 08:46.426
- Who wants biscuits?
- 谁想要饼干？

08:46.493 --> 08:49.663
- Huh?
- What about you, mister?
- 啊？
- 你呢，先生？

08:49.730 --> 08:52.700
Buy some biscuits from
a sweet little girl?
买一些饼干
一个可爱的小女孩？

08:52.766 --> 08:54.467
- Are you kidding?
- 你在开玩笑吧？

08:54.534 --> 08:56.970
Everyone's chompers
have gone missing.
大家都在咀嚼
已经失踪了。

08:57.037 --> 08:58.772
How are we supposed
to chew biscuits
我们又该如何
咀嚼饼干

08:58.839 --> 09:01.074
if we ain't got no teeth?
如果我们没有牙齿呢？

09:01.141 --> 09:03.677
[all groaning]
[全都呻吟]

09:03.744 --> 09:05.545
- [chuckling]
- [轻笑]

09:05.613 --> 09:08.148
[slams trunk]
[猛击后备箱]

09:08.215 --> 09:12.519
Looks like I borrowed
everyone's dentures.
看来我借了
每个人的假牙。

09:12.586 --> 09:14.187
[laughs]
[笑]

09:14.254 --> 09:17.024
[screams]
Ooh-ie!
[尖叫声]
哦-即！

09:17.090 --> 09:21.428
* *
**
**
**

09:21.494 --> 09:24.364
[blender whirring]
[搅拌机嗡嗡作响]

09:24.431 --> 09:26.133
* *
**
**
**

09:26.199 --> 09:29.970
Get your biscuit mush
right here, nice and soft.
得到你的饼干糊
就在这里，又好又软。

09:30.037 --> 09:33.140
We do the chewing
so you don't have to.
我们进行咀嚼
所以你不必这样做。

09:33.206 --> 09:37.044
- Oh, yeah.
- Homemade biscuits.
- 哦，是的。
- 自制饼干。

09:37.110 --> 09:40.180
- Lovely mush.
- 可爱的糊状。

09:40.247 --> 09:44.985
- Well, I guess that's it.
Time to call it a day.
- 嗯，我想就是这样。
是时候到此为止了。

09:45.052 --> 09:47.621
[cart squeaking]
- Live and learn, Pearly girl.
[推车吱吱作响]
- 活到老学到老，珍珠女孩。

09:47.688 --> 09:50.557
That's just the way
the biscuit bounces.
就是这样
饼干弹起来。

09:50.624 --> 09:51.959
[chuckling]
[轻笑]

09:52.025 --> 09:55.262
- Make mine extra mushy.
- 让我的更加糊状。

09:57.965 --> 10:01.468
- [laughs]
- [笑]

10:01.534 --> 10:03.070
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

10:03.136 --> 10:05.038
- Aw, hey there, Pearly girl.
- 哦，嘿，珍珠女孩。

10:05.105 --> 10:07.074
Sorry you didn't win
the competition.
抱歉你没赢
比赛。

10:07.140 --> 10:09.977
- Oh, I didn't lose yet.
- You didn't?
- 哦，我还没输。
- 你没有？

10:10.043 --> 10:14.514
- Nope, I realized there was
one more person to sell to,
- 不，我意识到有
又一个要卖给的人，

10:14.581 --> 10:17.818
and I know how to get him
to buy anything.
我知道如何得到他
买任何东西。

10:17.885 --> 10:20.487
[laughs]
- Oh.
[笑]
- 哦。

10:20.553 --> 10:22.790
I don't like
where this is going.
我不喜欢
这是怎么回事。

10:22.856 --> 10:25.726
- [straining]
- [紧张]

10:25.793 --> 10:29.863
[sobbing]
Oh, Daddy!
[抽泣]
哦，爸爸！

10:29.930 --> 10:35.002
Buy my biscuits.
[sobbing]
买我的饼干。
[抽泣]

10:35.068 --> 10:38.571
Oh, Daddy!
- No, I can't-- I--
哦，爸爸！
- 不，我不能--我--

10:38.638 --> 10:41.574
- [sobbing]
- [抽泣]

10:44.177 --> 10:45.713
[water gurgling]
[流水潺潺]

10:48.481 --> 10:52.753
- All right,
I'll buy your biscuits.
- 好吧，
我去买你的饼干。

10:52.820 --> 10:56.890
- Thanks, Daddy.
Mwah!
- 谢谢，爸爸。
哇！

10:56.957 --> 10:59.192
We're going to Mars.
我们要去火星。

10:59.259 --> 11:05.198
- [sobs]
Hm, these are tasty.
- [抽泣]
嗯，这些很好吃。

11:07.801 --> 11:11.104
[rocket whooshes]
[火箭呼啸]

11:12.439 --> 11:15.575
- Whew, that was some
mighty fine selling,
- 哇，那是一些
强大的精品销售，

11:15.642 --> 11:16.676
Science Scouts.
科学侦察兵。

11:16.744 --> 11:18.846
Now, we can afford
to boldly expand
现在，我们有能力
大胆拓展

11:18.912 --> 11:21.148
into new biscuit markets.
进入新的饼干市场。

11:21.214 --> 11:22.082
[together]
Hooray!
[一起]
万岁！

11:22.149 --> 11:23.283
[knocking]
[敲门声]

11:23.350 --> 11:25.185
[together]
Huh?
[一起]
啊？

11:25.252 --> 11:27.287
- Greetings, Earth creatures.
- 你好，地球生物。

11:27.354 --> 11:30.657
Would you like to purchase
some Astro Biscuits?
您想购买吗
一些天文饼干？

11:30.724 --> 11:35.262
We are raising money
for a trip to Earth.
我们正在筹集资金
去地球旅行。

11:37.697 --> 11:39.166
- OK, y'all.
- 好吧，你们大家。

11:39.232 --> 11:40.533
If we earn enough money,
如果我们赚到足够的钱，

11:40.600 --> 11:42.535
we can afford a trip
to Jupiter.
我们负担得起旅行的费用
到木星。

11:44.371 --> 11:47.474
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

11:53.981 --> 11:57.417
- Vroom, vroom!
Vrow!
- 呜呜呜！
呜呜！

11:57.484 --> 12:01.688
My boat was stuck in reverse
for a whole mile.
我的船被困在倒车里
一英里。

12:01.755 --> 12:05.926
I turned left and backed into
a mountain of giant springs.
我向左转并倒车进入
一座充满巨泉的山。

12:05.993 --> 12:07.795
- Whoa!
Wow.
- 哇！
哇。

12:07.861 --> 12:09.496
Righteous, dude.
正义啊，伙计。

12:09.562 --> 12:11.965
- Then, the boat
sprung forward,
- 然后，船
向前猛冲，

12:12.032 --> 12:15.568
up onto an unfinished bridge,
where we bounced--
登上一座未完工的桥，
我们弹跳的地方——

12:15.635 --> 12:18.405
yoink, yoink--
from column to column
哟哟哟——
从一列到另一列

12:18.471 --> 12:21.541
and got caught on the hook
of a construction crane,
并被钩住
建筑起重机，

12:21.608 --> 12:23.811
where we swung out
over the city
我们出去的地方
城市上空

12:23.877 --> 12:27.815
until we landed
on a garbage dumpster.
直到我们着陆
在垃圾箱上。

12:27.881 --> 12:32.052
- Thank you, SpongeBob,
for that melodramatic
- 谢谢你，海绵宝宝，
为了那个戏剧性的

12:32.119 --> 12:34.687
retelling of our
last driving lesson.
复述我们的
最后一次驾驶课。

12:34.754 --> 12:37.324
- My pleasure.
[engine revving]
- 我的荣幸。
[发动机转速]

12:37.390 --> 12:39.259
[horse neighing]
[马嘶声]

12:40.928 --> 12:44.564
[laughs nervously]
Wall came out of nowhere.
[紧张地笑]
墙凭空出现。

12:44.631 --> 12:46.366
[sparse applause]
[稀少的掌声]

12:46.433 --> 12:48.235
- Settle down, class.
- 安静下来，上课。

12:48.301 --> 12:51.404
I'm elated to announce
that today
我很高兴地宣布
今天

12:51.471 --> 12:55.242
we have a new driving student
with us.
我们有一个新的驾驶学生
和我们一起。

12:55.308 --> 12:57.310
Come in and introduce yourself.
进来介绍一下你自己吧。

12:57.377 --> 12:59.646
- Thank you so much
for this opportunity.
- 非常感谢
为了这个机会。

12:59.712 --> 13:02.415
Acceleration T. Greenlight's
the name,
加速 T. Greenlight
名字，

13:02.482 --> 13:04.784
and teaching driving
is my game.
以及驾驶教学
是我的游戏。

13:04.852 --> 13:06.419
- What?
- 什么？

13:06.486 --> 13:10.623
- I'm the owner and operator of
the Greenlight Driving School.
- 我是所有者和经营者
绿光驾驶学校。

13:10.690 --> 13:11.791
[horn honks]
[喇叭鸣响]

13:11.859 --> 13:13.793
- All right, mister,
you can just--
- 好吧，先生，
你可以——

13:13.861 --> 13:15.963
- And I guarantee
a driver's license
- 我保证
驾驶执照

13:16.029 --> 13:19.766
to anyone after only one drive
around the block,
仅一趟车程后即可向任何人
街区周围，

13:19.833 --> 13:22.002
and at half the price
that Mrs. Puff charges.
并且以一半的价格
帕夫夫人指控道。

13:22.069 --> 13:23.136
[chuckles]
[笑声]

13:23.203 --> 13:25.372
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

13:25.438 --> 13:27.841
- I've dealt
with his kind before.
- 我已经处理过
以前和他的同类。

13:27.908 --> 13:30.243
[desk buzzes]
[办公桌嗡嗡作响]

13:32.712 --> 13:38.385
No, I am not going back
to the slammer.
不，我不会回去
到砰砰声。

13:38.451 --> 13:41.221
- Once around the block
and your license is a lock.
- 绕过街区后
而你的执照就是一把锁。

13:41.288 --> 13:45.192
Follow me!
Right this way, beep, beep!
跟我来！
就这样，嘟嘟嘟！

13:45.258 --> 13:47.895
- Beep, beep!
Beep, beep!
- 嘟嘟嘟！
嘟嘟嘟！

13:47.961 --> 13:51.965
- Class, where are you going?
Don't listen to him.
- 同学们，你们要去哪里？
别听他的。

13:52.032 --> 13:54.734
Come back.
We have a lesson.
回来。
我们有一个教训。

13:54.801 --> 13:55.969
[sighs]
[叹气]

13:56.036 --> 13:59.072
- Welcome, suckers--
I mean, students--
-欢迎，笨蛋--
我的意思是，同学们——

13:59.139 --> 14:02.109
to the Greenlight
Driving School.
绿光
驾校。

14:02.175 --> 14:06.046
- I can't believe
everyone left me.
- 我不敢相信
每个人都离开了我。

14:06.113 --> 14:08.248
- Not everyone!
- 不是每个人！

14:09.349 --> 14:11.784
- [sighs]
SpongeBob.
- [叹气]
海绵宝宝。

14:11.851 --> 14:14.287
I might have known.
我可能已经知道了。

14:16.556 --> 14:19.893
Whoa!
- No problem.
哇！
- 没问题。

14:19.960 --> 14:22.462
- Careful.
Watch out.
- 小心。
当心。

14:22.529 --> 14:24.431
- I got this.
- Slow down.
- 我明白了。
- 减速。

14:24.497 --> 14:27.034
Brakes, brakes!
刹车，刹车！

14:27.100 --> 14:30.503
[screaming]
- Sorry.
[尖叫]
- 抱歉。

14:30.570 --> 14:34.707
- Oh, Neptune.
- Whoops.
- 哦，海王星。
- 哎呀。

14:34.774 --> 14:37.144
Here you go.
That's for today's lesson.
干得好。
这就是今天的课程。

14:37.210 --> 14:38.611
[grunts]
[咕哝]

14:38.678 --> 14:40.447
Don't spend it all
in one place.
别花光一切
在一个地方。

14:40.513 --> 14:42.349
See you next week.
下周见。

14:42.415 --> 14:44.651
* La, la, la, la, la, la, la *
*啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦*

14:46.053 --> 14:47.354
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

14:47.420 --> 14:50.290
- Yessiree,
once around the block.
- 是的，
绕街区一圈。

14:52.692 --> 14:55.062
[laughs]
[笑]

14:55.128 --> 14:57.297
Congratulations!
恭喜！

14:57.364 --> 14:59.299
You're a licensed driver.
你是有执照的司机。

14:59.366 --> 15:02.002
- Gnarly.
- 粗糙。

15:02.069 --> 15:03.136
[cash register chimes]
[收银机铃声]

15:03.203 --> 15:04.471
[chuckles]
[笑声]

15:04.537 --> 15:06.506
[boat crashes]
[船失事]

15:06.573 --> 15:08.741
- I want a license.
- Me too!
- 我想要一个许可证。
- 我也是！

15:08.808 --> 15:11.711
- [scoffs]
Acceleration T. Greenlight.
- [嘲笑]
加速 T. 绿光。

15:11.778 --> 15:15.715
Yah! Bills?
Overdue, delinquent?
啊！账单？
逾期、逾期？

15:15.782 --> 15:18.518
[gasps]
"Pay or die?"
[喘气]
“付钱还是死？”

15:18.585 --> 15:20.820
How will I ever pay these bills
我将如何支付这些账单

15:20.887 --> 15:24.024
teaching SpongeBob
only once a week?
教学海绵宝宝
每周只有一次？

15:24.091 --> 15:26.059
Oh.
哦。

15:27.794 --> 15:31.364
- Yah!
- Yoo-hoo, SpongeBob?
- 啊！
- 哟吼，海绵宝宝？

15:31.431 --> 15:33.500
Hop in for your next lesson.
参加您的下一课。

15:33.566 --> 15:35.568
- Oh, you're mistaken,
Mrs. Puff.
-哦，你错了，
泡芙女士。

15:35.635 --> 15:37.604
Today's not my lesson day.
今天不是我上课的日子。

15:37.670 --> 15:40.940
- I just upgraded you
to Super Gold status.
- 我刚刚升级了你
至超级黄金状态。

15:41.008 --> 15:44.677
You'll have lessons every day,
with the corresponding fees,
每天你都会有功课
以及相应的费用，

15:44.744 --> 15:47.414
of course.
- Yeah, but I--
当然。
- 是的，但是我--

15:47.480 --> 15:49.216
I'm on my way to work.
我正在上班的路上。

15:49.282 --> 15:51.551
- Get in the boat!
- Yes, Mrs. Puff.
- 上船吧！
- 是的，帕芙女士。

15:51.618 --> 15:54.154
- Now, drive.
- Aye, aye.
- 现在，开车。
- 是的，是的。

15:54.221 --> 15:57.157
[bright music]
[明亮的音乐]

15:57.224 --> 15:59.993
* *
**
**
**

16:00.060 --> 16:02.429
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

16:02.495 --> 16:05.965
Wow!
I can't look!
哇！
我看不下去！

16:06.033 --> 16:09.369
[screams]
Stop!
[尖叫声]
停下来！

16:09.436 --> 16:12.172
* *
**
**
**

16:12.239 --> 16:14.307
[boat thuds]
[船的撞击声]

16:14.374 --> 16:16.009
- Ooh, looky there.
- 哦，看那儿。

16:16.076 --> 16:19.146
It's that really successful
driving school.
这真的很成功
驾校。

16:19.212 --> 16:22.482
- Hey, thanks.
- Thanks.
- 嘿，谢谢。
- 谢谢。

16:22.549 --> 16:24.084
- [laughs]
Great.
- [笑]
太棒了。

16:24.151 --> 16:26.253
I can drive now.
我现在可以开车了。

16:26.319 --> 16:29.856
* *
**
**
**

16:29.922 --> 16:31.558
- Huh, thanks!
- 嗯，谢谢！

16:31.624 --> 16:33.893
* *
**
**
**

16:33.960 --> 16:35.962
- Hello, loser.
- 你好，失败者。

16:37.997 --> 16:39.532
- Don't worry, Mrs. Puff.
- 别担心，帕芙女士。

16:39.599 --> 16:42.602
I'm loyal to you and only you.
我忠于你，也只忠于你。

16:42.669 --> 16:44.737
- Oh, thank you, Sponge...
-哦，谢谢你，海绵……

16:44.804 --> 16:48.241
[tires screech]
Bob!
[轮胎尖叫声]
鲍勃！

16:48.308 --> 16:51.478
Oh, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!
哦，哇哦，哇哦，哇哦！

16:51.544 --> 16:54.881
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

16:54.947 --> 16:57.417
[boat crashes]
[船失事]

16:57.484 --> 17:00.420
[trident point thuds]
[三叉戟尖轰鸣]

17:00.487 --> 17:02.189
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

17:02.255 --> 17:06.159
That was a long day's
driving lesson, Gary.
那是漫长的一天
驾驶课，加里。

17:06.226 --> 17:08.661
[boat honking]
[船鸣笛]

17:08.728 --> 17:12.599
- SpongeBob,
time for your next lesson!
- 海绵宝宝，
下一课的时间到了！

17:12.665 --> 17:15.001
- Yeah, but it's
the middle of the night.
- 是的，但是它是
半夜。

17:15.068 --> 17:16.603
- Tonight's lesson is...
- [screams]
- 今晚的课程是...
- [尖叫]

17:16.669 --> 17:18.405
- Late-night driving.
- 深夜开车。

17:18.471 --> 17:20.907
Of course,
there'll be an extra fee.
当然，
会有额外费用。

17:20.973 --> 17:22.909
Hurry up.
赶快。

17:22.975 --> 17:27.280
- [yawns]
Coming, Mrs. Puff.
- [哈欠]
来了，帕夫夫人。

17:27.347 --> 17:31.984
- The most important part of
night driving is staying awake.
- 最重要的部分
夜间驾驶就是保持清醒。

17:32.051 --> 17:33.186
Some loud music...
一些吵闹的音乐...

17:33.253 --> 17:36.423
[bombastic big band music]
[夸张的大乐队音乐]

17:36.489 --> 17:38.558
And coffee should do it.
咖啡应该可以做到这一点。

17:38.625 --> 17:42.295
- Eeeh!
- Watch it.
- 哎呀！
- 看着它。

17:42.362 --> 17:43.896
- Get off the road!
- 离开道路！

17:43.963 --> 17:46.899
[boats crashing]
[船只相撞]

17:49.736 --> 17:52.639
[bright music]
[明亮的音乐]

17:52.705 --> 17:55.074
* *
**
**
**

17:55.142 --> 17:58.077
- I'll see you in the morning
for tomorrow's lesson.
- 早上见
为了明天的课。

17:58.145 --> 18:00.880
- But tomorrow is Sunday.
- 但明天是周日。

18:00.947 --> 18:03.049
- It's your Sunday
driver lesson,
- 这是你的周日
驾驶课程，

18:03.116 --> 18:06.486
you silly billy boy.
你这个愚蠢的比利男孩。

18:06.553 --> 18:10.890
- Yeah, I'm a silly billy boy.
- 是的，我是一个愚蠢的比利男孩。

18:10.957 --> 18:14.060
Finally, a day to myself.
终于有属于自己的一天了。

18:14.127 --> 18:16.729
[humming melody]
[哼唱的旋律]

18:16.796 --> 18:18.598
[boat honks]
Huh?
[船鸣笛]
啊？

18:18.665 --> 18:23.035
- Today's lesson, ice driving.
- 今天的课程，冰上驾驶。

18:23.102 --> 18:25.037
- Whoa.
- Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!
- 哇哦。
- 哇，哇，哇，哇！

18:25.104 --> 18:27.474
Turn into the slide.
Foot off the gas.
转入幻灯片。
踩下油门。

18:27.540 --> 18:29.276
Pray to Neptune.
向海王星祈祷。

18:29.342 --> 18:30.410
[screams]
[尖叫声]

18:30.477 --> 18:33.780
* *
**
**
**

18:33.846 --> 18:36.749
- Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!
- Whoa, whoa, whoa!
- 哇，哇，哇，哇，哇！
- 哇，哇，哇！

18:36.816 --> 18:38.585
- Hey, that actually worked.
- 嘿，这确实有效。

18:38.651 --> 18:40.420
[ice cracking]
[冰裂]

18:40.487 --> 18:42.655
[boat splashes]
[船溅起水花]

18:42.722 --> 18:45.492
- [yodeling]
- [岳得尔调]

18:45.558 --> 18:48.595
Just what I needed,
some me time.
正是我所需要的，
一些我的时间。

18:48.661 --> 18:50.430
[inhales deeply]
[深吸一口气]

18:50.497 --> 18:52.098
[boat honks]
Yikes!
[船鸣笛]
哎呀！

18:52.165 --> 18:53.833
What lesson now?
现在什么课？

18:53.900 --> 18:56.603
- Mountain driving lesson.
- 山地驾驶课程。

18:56.669 --> 18:59.906
[screaming]
[尖叫]

19:01.474 --> 19:04.611
- Look out below!
- 看下面！

19:06.579 --> 19:10.049
[explosion]
[爆炸]

19:10.116 --> 19:12.485
- Nurse,
I'm unzipping him now.
- 护士，
我现在正在解开他的拉链。

19:12.552 --> 19:14.221
[monitors beeping]
[监视器发出蜂鸣声]

19:14.287 --> 19:18.525
- Oh, hold on, Doctor.
Mrs. Puff, are you in there?
- 哦，等一下，医生。
普芙女士，你在里面吗？

19:18.591 --> 19:20.827
[echoing]
Are you in there?
[回声]
你在里面吗？

19:20.893 --> 19:25.198
- Don't be silly, SpongeBob.
How would I fit in there?
- 别傻了，海绵宝宝。
我该如何适应那里？

19:25.265 --> 19:29.869
- Yeah,
there's only room for one, me.
- 是的，
这里只能容纳一个人，就是我。

19:29.936 --> 19:32.639
[together]
Oh, Patrick.
[一起]
哦，帕特里克。

19:34.307 --> 19:37.043
- Time for your next
driving lesson.
- 下一个的时间
驾驶课。

19:37.109 --> 19:39.912
- But, Mrs. Puff,
I'm totally broke.
- 但是，帕夫夫人，
我彻底破产了。

19:39.979 --> 19:42.382
I can't pay for
any more lessons.
我无法支付
还有什么教训。

19:42.449 --> 19:48.054
- Well, I guess it's
the end of the road for me.
- 嗯，我想是这样
对我来说，路的尽头。

19:48.120 --> 19:52.091
- Can we get some lunch now?
Your stomach is empty
- 我们现在可以吃午饭了吗？
你的胃是空的

19:53.893 --> 19:56.629
- [sighs]
Out of business.
- [叹气]
没生意了。

19:56.696 --> 20:00.800
I thought my school
would last forever.
我以为我的学校
将永远持续下去。

20:02.235 --> 20:06.506
SpongeBob,
the one-sponge wrecking crew.
海绵宝宝，
一支海绵破坏队

20:06.573 --> 20:09.108
[bell dings]
Ooh!
[铃声]
哦！

20:09.175 --> 20:12.011
Hold on, SpongeBob.
That's it.
坚持住，海绵宝宝。
就是这样。

20:12.078 --> 20:15.915
I can't believe I've been
going about this all wrong.
我不敢相信我曾经
这一切都是错误的。

20:15.982 --> 20:17.884
[laughs]
[笑]

20:17.950 --> 20:20.253
- Happy trails, snail.
- 快乐的小径，蜗牛。

20:20.320 --> 20:21.821
- [meows]
- [喵]

20:24.056 --> 20:26.893
- Well, if it isn't Mrs. Puff.
- 好吧，如果不是帕芙夫人的话。

20:26.959 --> 20:29.696
What brings you to
my humble driving school?
是什么让你来到
我简陋的驾校？

20:29.762 --> 20:32.365
- You say you can get
any student a license
- 你说你能得到
任何学生都有执照

20:32.432 --> 20:34.267
with just one lesson?
只需一堂课？

20:34.334 --> 20:36.168
- Guaranteed.
- 有保证。

20:36.235 --> 20:40.273
- Well, I've got
a live one for you.
- 嗯，我有
为您准备了一份现场直播。

20:43.543 --> 20:47.547
[laughs]
Oh, good luck!
[笑]
哦，祝你好运！

20:47.614 --> 20:50.350
You'll need it.
Mwah.
你会需要它。
哇。

20:50.417 --> 20:53.986
[laughing]
[笑]

20:54.053 --> 20:56.356
- The trick to being
a licensed driver
- 存在的秘诀
有执照的司机

20:56.423 --> 20:59.392
is going once around the block.
绕着街区转一圈。

20:59.459 --> 21:02.295
Whoa!
哇！

21:02.362 --> 21:06.065
[screaming]
[尖叫]

21:06.132 --> 21:08.835
What are you doing?
Let me out!
你在干什么？
放我出去吧！

21:08.901 --> 21:11.604
- Oh, I haven't learned
"let me out" yet,
- 哦，我还没学过
“放我出去”，

21:11.671 --> 21:14.240
but I'll show you
what I have learned.
但我会告诉你
我学到了什么。

21:14.307 --> 21:16.142
[engine rumbles]
[发动机隆隆声]

21:16.208 --> 21:17.310
- Whoa!
- 哇！

21:17.377 --> 21:21.348
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!
哇、哇、哇、哇！

21:21.414 --> 21:23.650
Whoa, ah, whoa!
哇啊啊哇啊！

21:23.716 --> 21:25.652
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

21:25.718 --> 21:28.187
[boats crashing]
[船只相撞]

21:28.254 --> 21:31.991
Stop!
Stop this boat, I beg of you!
停止！
停下这艘船，我求你了！

21:32.058 --> 21:34.494
- The trick
to being a passenger
- 窍门
作为乘客

21:34.561 --> 21:37.229
is to give up all control.
就是放弃一切控制权。

21:37.296 --> 21:40.232
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

21:40.299 --> 21:42.502
[boat crashes]
[船失事]

21:42.569 --> 21:44.036
- How's my driving?
- 我的驾驶技术怎么样？

21:44.103 --> 21:46.773
- Well, if it isn't SpongeBob.
- 好吧，如果不是海绵宝宝的话。

21:46.839 --> 21:49.041
And you've captured
the notorious
并且你已经捕获了
臭名昭著的

21:49.108 --> 21:51.378
Acceleration T. Greenlight.
加速 T. 绿光。

21:51.444 --> 21:53.946
He's been selling
phony driver's licenses
他一直在卖
假驾驶执照

21:54.013 --> 21:56.148
throughout the seabed.
整个海底。

21:56.215 --> 21:58.451
- And I would have
gotten away with it, too,
- 我会的
也侥幸逃脱了

21:58.518 --> 22:01.788
if it wasn't for the
worst driver in all the oceans.
如果不是为了
所有海洋中最糟糕的司机。

22:01.854 --> 22:05.291
[laughter]
[笑声]

22:05.358 --> 22:08.595
- I wonder
who he meant by that.
- 我想知道
他指的是谁。

22:08.661 --> 22:12.331
- Thank you, SpongeBob.
Do go on.
- 谢谢你，海绵宝宝。
继续吧。

22:12.399 --> 22:15.267
- Then, Acceleration and I
went down the mountain,
——然后，加速和我
下了山，

22:15.334 --> 22:17.670
and we drove through the fog.
[crashes]
我们开车穿过雾气。
[崩溃]

22:17.737 --> 22:20.072
And we crashed on the ice.
我们在冰上坠毁了。

22:20.139 --> 22:24.377
- I love that story, SpongeBob.
Tell it again.
- 我喜欢这个故事，海绵宝宝。
再说一遍。

22:24.444 --> 22:26.479
[objects crashing
and thudding]
[物体崩溃
和重击]

22:26.546 --> 22:29.716
- Beep, beep, beep, beep.
Beep, beep, beep, beep, beep.
- 嘟嘟嘟，嘟嘟嘟，嘟嘟嘟。
嘟嘟嘟，嘟嘟嘟，嘟嘟嘟，嘟嘟嘟。

- 嘟嘟嘟，嘟嘟嘟，嘟嘟嘟。
嘟嘟嘟，嘟嘟嘟，嘟嘟嘟，嘟嘟嘟。